      "text": "[6:40PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nFree flow of traffic in and out of Adeniji Adele road through Oba's Palace, while movement ine police post is being restricted due to the collapsed bulling along the axis.\n\nTinubu Square connecting Nnamdi Azikiwe street enroute Tom Jones intersection is busy due to market activities.\n\nIdumota underneath the bridge inward journey Eyin Eyo connecting Balogun street is a steady movement for now.\n\nIllubinrin connecting Carter bridge inward journey Ijora olopa as well as Oyingbo is moving as expected.\n\nImpediment record is negative, while traffic officers are still very much on ground managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
